{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"theme-modules","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Theme Modules"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bundled themes are isolated objects. Importing one theme does not include another or generate CSS."}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Export"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Module"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"auroraXTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/aurora-x"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"draculaTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/dracula"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"githubDarkTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"githubLightTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Light"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gruvboxDarkTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/gruvbox-dark"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gruvboxLightTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/gruvbox-light"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Light"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"monokaiTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/monokai"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"nordTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/nord"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"oneDarkProTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/one-dark-pro"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"solarizedDarkTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/solarized-dark"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"solarizedLightTheme"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/solarized-light"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Light"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Each module provides both its named export and the same object as its default export."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\n\nconst css = createThemeCss({\n  light: githubLightTheme,\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The objects satisfy "},{"type":"link","href":"theme#highlighttheme","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HighlightTheme"}]},{"type":"text","value":". See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../guides/themes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"theme guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for custom selectors, CSS output, and authoring a theme."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"theme-modules","text":"Theme Modules","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Theme Modules\n\nBundled themes are isolated objects. Importing one theme does not include another or generate CSS.\n\n| Export | Module | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `auroraXTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/aurora-x` | Dark |\n| `draculaTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/dracula` | Dark |\n| `githubDarkTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark` | Dark |\n| `githubLightTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light` | Light |\n| `gruvboxDarkTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/gruvbox-dark` | Dark |\n| `gruvboxLightTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/gruvbox-light` | Light |\n| `monokaiTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/monokai` | Dark |\n| `nordTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/nord` | Dark |\n| `oneDarkProTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/one-dark-pro` | Dark |\n| `solarizedDarkTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/solarized-dark` | Dark |\n| `solarizedLightTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/solarized-light` | Light |\n\nEach module provides both its named export and the same object as its default export.\n\n```ts\nimport { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\n\nconst css = createThemeCss({\n  light: githubLightTheme,\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\n})\n```\n\nThe objects satisfy [`HighlightTheme`](theme#highlighttheme). See the [theme guide](../guides/themes) for custom selectors, CSS output, and authoring a theme.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Theme Modules\n---\n\n# Theme Modules\n\nBundled themes are isolated objects. Importing one theme does not include another or generate CSS.\n\n| Export | Module | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `auroraXTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/aurora-x` | Dark |\n| `draculaTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/dracula` | Dark |\n| `githubDarkTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark` | Dark |\n| `githubLightTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light` | Light |\n| `gruvboxDarkTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/gruvbox-dark` | Dark |\n| `gruvboxLightTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/gruvbox-light` | Light |\n| `monokaiTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/monokai` | Dark |\n| `nordTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/nord` | Dark |\n| `oneDarkProTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/one-dark-pro` | Dark |\n| `solarizedDarkTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/solarized-dark` | Dark |\n| `solarizedLightTheme` | `@tanstack/highlight/themes/solarized-light` | Light |\n\nEach module provides both its named export and the same object as its default export.\n\n```ts\nimport { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\n\nconst css = createThemeCss({\n  light: githubLightTheme,\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\n})\n```\n\nThe objects satisfy [`HighlightTheme`](theme#highlighttheme). See the [theme guide](../guides/themes) for custom selectors, CSS output, and authoring a theme.\n"}
